 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Stay.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "This is not a state visit. It is a family matter.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I am not family, Amma. I should leave.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You will stay.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Valiyamma.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Highness. And the future.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "prince",
    "senior_rani",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RANI"
   ],
   "text": "The past remembers the debt, Padmini Amma. We have brought the boy to see the walls that saved his uncle.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "prince",
    "senior_rani",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PRINCE"
   ],
   "text": "You are the Maratha. The one who trains horses to dance with muskets.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "prince"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I am.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "prince"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PRINCE"
   ],
   "text": "My uncle says you once killed three men in Goa with a chain still on your wrist.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "prince"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Your uncle exaggerates. It was two men.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "prince"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The third I only broke.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "prince"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PRINCE"
   ],
   "text": "I would like to learn how to break men.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "prince",
    "senior_rani",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PRINCE"
   ],
   "text": "When I am older.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "prince",
    "senior_rani",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RANI"
   ],
   "text": "You will learn many things when you are older. For now, you will learn to watch and remember.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "prince",
    "senior_rani"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RANI"
   ],
   "text": "That is what kings do before they act.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "prince",
    "senior_rani"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RANI"
   ],
   "text": "My brother trusts you. I am slower to trust. But I am told you have kept him alive when others would have let him fall.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "senior_rani"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RANI"
   ],
   "text": "That buys you my attention, if not yet my confidence.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "senior_rani"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I ask for nothing more, Highness.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "senior_rani"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RANI"
   ],
   "text": "Good. Men who ask for too much too quickly tend to lose what they already have.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "senior_rani"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Sit.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "prince",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Nagoji Sawant. You look ready to jump over the wall.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "prince",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Royal visits usually involve more warning, Highness. And fewer secrets.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "prince",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "This house has held bigger secrets than this.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Do you know why I trust Valiyamma more than my own ministers? Why her grain wagons pass my checkpoints without being searched?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "That leads to the cellar. Beneath the granary. Dark, full of spiders and the smell of old rice.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Thirty years ago I was not yet eight years old, but I was a hunted animal.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "The Lords of the Eight Houses, the Ettuveetil Pillamar, wanted my blood.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "I could trust no one. Not the palace, not the temples.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "I lived there for three weeks. I heard their boots on the floorboards above my head.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "I heard them threaten Valiyamma.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "I heard them hold a knife to her husband's throat.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "And what did she do?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "prince",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "I offered them buttermilk.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "And told them that if they woke my baby, I would curse their lineage for seven generations.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "They were superstitious men. They left.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "She hid me when I was hunted. She risked her house, her life, and her child for a prince who was fourth in line and had nothing to give her but promises.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You have kept those promises.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Not all of them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "I am here to offer you a son.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Not as a replacement for your son and husband, felled by the Pillamar's men,",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "but as a new staff for my Valiyamma to lean on in her old age.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Nagoji Sawant. You have commanded my horse. You have built my walls. You have bled at Colachel.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You serve me better than men who share my blood.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I serve the hand that feeds me.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "That is a mercenary's answer. The King needs more than a mercenary.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You are a stranger here. A man with no clan, no *tharavadu* to claim him.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "prince",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "In Travancore, a man without a house is like smoke. He drifts with the wind.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "prince",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "I cannot have my best cavalry commander drift.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "prince",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "The priests say a man's caste is written in bone.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "But I have found that even the gods' writing can be edited, if the ink is gold.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "The Chief Priest has discovered, after a surprisingly generous donation to the temple roof fund, that your lineage was not Maratha after all, but a lost branch of a Nair house that wandered north.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "A miracle.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "I formally request that the House of Padmini Amma accept a new son. Not of blood, but of water and oath.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "prince",
    "ramayyan",
    "senior_rani",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "That he be given the rights of the hearth, the protection of the name, and the duty of the lineage.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "prince",
    "ramayyan",
    "senior_rani",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "He eats too much. And he cleans his sword in the house, which annoys the servants.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "And he broods like an old woman when it rains.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "This mark says you belong to men who wanted to break you. It says you are property.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "It says you are less than the goats they slaughtered for their feasts.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "But this house says otherwise. This house says you are mine.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "And no brand, no empire, no company of merchants will ever own what I have claimed.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You are already my son in every way that matters to the gods. The only thing left is to tell the gods formally.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "I accept.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RANI"
   ],
   "text": "Witness. This is how loyalty is woven.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "prince",
    "senior_rani"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RANI"
   ],
   "text": "Not just with gold, but with kinship.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "prince",
    "senior_rani"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You are Nagoji of Padmini's House now. The stranger is gone. Do not let us find him again.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I will not, Highness.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "prince",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Good. Come.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "prince",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Kings do not always sit on thrones. Sometimes they sit in the dark and wait for a woman with a sharp tongue to save them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "prince",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "A name. You need one that fits this house.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "prince",
    "senior_rani",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RANI (from the doorway)"
   ],
   "text": "In this land, a man belongs to his mother's line. You have no mother here. But you have Valiyamma.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "prince",
    "senior_rani",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Ananthan. For the serpent on which Lord Padmanabha rests.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "The one who holds up the world without asking for thanks.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Ananthan Pillai. It will do. The records will reflect it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Ananthan Pillai. Now you look like you belong.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "prince",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Dutch steel, taken off my beach and hammered into something worth carrying.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "If you must wear a foreigner's iron at your belt, let it carry my sign.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "This is too much.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "It is exactly enough. A name ties you to a house. A blade ties you to a duty.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Ananthan Pillai. It suits you less than I expected.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "It will grow into me. Or I into it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You have a house now. A name. A mother who will fight tigers for you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "The stranger is gone.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The stranger was always a story I told myself. A way to keep one foot outside the door. In case I needed to run.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "And now?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Now I have a door of my own. And I would like you to come through it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "That is bold, for a man who once told me he made no promises.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I am not making a promise. I am making an invitation.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Padmini...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Has gone to the temple.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The servants know better than to disturb the son of the house when he is entertaining.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You have grown arrogant very quickly, Ananthan Pillai.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I have grown certain. There is a difference.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "The last time, I brought you here.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The last time, I had nothing to offer but myself. Now I have walls. A roof. A name that will not wash away with the next tide.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You think that matters to me?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I think you have spent years being the one who decides. The one who comes and goes. The one who holds the door.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Tonight, let me hold it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "One night. Then we see.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "The man who washed up on this coast would not have taken my hand. He would have waited for me to take his.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "He had nothing to offer.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "He had himself. That was always enough. He just did not know it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "I will come again. Not because you have a house now, but because you finally believe you deserve one.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  }
 ]
}